{
  "dom_id": "step-e13362",
  "name": "Example: Finding a CDF Given a PDF With a Lower Bound",
  "problem": "Given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14122710/assets/9bab7992e89938dad8c9fafb358532958e1588f2b80b6cb05f60c2e6c8a20fb7.svg)\n\nfind the cumulative distribution function $F(x).$",
  "worked_solution": "Since our random variable $X$ has a probability distribution function $f(x)$ that is strictly positive only for $x \\geq 0,$ the cumulative distribution function takes the following form:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14122710/assets/d34196e7c9b9112e71a297c2b970c9f6318b225755f74b955ddd44c9566a7b82.svg)\n\nFor the given probability density function, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{x}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{0}^{x}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\ \\text{ } & =-{e}^{-t}{|}_{0}^{x} \\\\  & =-{e}^{-x}+1 \\\\  & =1-{e}^{-x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the cumulative distribution function is given by\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14122710/assets/a09009b1a1ee17d45d31493194c3bf48c0835c8f0a944d39a232676bb8f59491.svg)",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e13362\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Finding a CDF Given a PDF With a Lower Bound</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e13362\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                  